{"t":"Friends and Traders","s":"friends-and-traders-26d67","k":"quest","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p><b>Friends and Traders</b> are a collection of quests. They are just united in the same article due to their placement in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Quest%20Log\">Quest Log</a> - they aren't separated and are all listed under Friends and Traders. \n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Friends and Traders Quests</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 45px;\">Min Level</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 45px;\">Rec Level</th><th style=\"width: 45px; text-align: center;\">Prem</th><th style=\"width: 190px;\">Location</th><th style=\"\">Reward</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 190px;\"><a href=\"#/quest/the-scatterbrained-sorcerer-quest\">The Scatterbrained Sorcerer Quest</a></td><td style=\"width: 45px;\">0</td><td style=\"width: 45px;\">8</td><td style=\"width: 45px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"width: 190px;\">Around <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> - <a href=\"#/wiki/Eclesius\">Eclesius</a>' house, <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'Dendriel</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a></td><td>5350 gp and 10650 experience.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 190px;\"><a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a></td><td style=\"width: 45px;\">35</td><td style=\"width: 45px;\"></td><td style=\"width: 45px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></td><td style=\"width: 190px;\">West of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Ashta%27daramai\">Blue Djinn Fortress</a>, Near <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a></td><td>Delicious dishes, achievement <a href=\"#/wiki/Culinary%20Master\">Culinary Master</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Jean%20Pierre%27s%20Cookbook%20I\">Jean Pierre's Cookbook I</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Jean%20Pierre%27s%20Cookbook%20II\">Jean Pierre's Cookbook II</a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 190px;\"><a href=\"#/quest/the-blessed-stake-quest\">The Blessed Stake Quest</a></td><td style=\"width: 45px;\">0</td><td style=\"width: 45px;\">15+</td><td style=\"width: 45px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></td><td style=\"width: 190px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'Dendriel</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope\">Port Hope</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty Bay</a></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Blessed%20Wooden%20Stake\">Blessed Wooden Stake</a>, achievement <a href=\"#/wiki/Blessed%21\">Blessed!</a>.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 190px;\"><a href=\"#/quest/the-mermaid-marina-quest\">The Mermaid Marina Quest</a></td><td style=\"width: 45px;\">0</td><td style=\"width: 45px;\">10+</td><td style=\"width: 45px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></td><td style=\"width: 190px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Meriana\">Meriana</a>.</td><td>Ability to deal with <a href=\"#/wiki/Marina\">Marina</a>.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 190px;\"><a href=\"#/quest/the-sweaty-cyclops-quest\">The Sweaty Cyclops Quest</a></td><td style=\"width: 45px;\">0</td><td style=\"width: 45px;\">20+</td><td style=\"width: 45px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"width: 190px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'Dendriel</a>.</td><td>Ability to deal with <a href=\"#/wiki/A%20Sweaty%20Cyclops\">A Sweaty Cyclops</a>.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 190px;\"><a href=\"#/quest/the-travelling-trader-quest\">The Travelling Trader Quest</a></td><td style=\"width: 45px;\">0</td><td style=\"width: 45px;\">50+</td><td style=\"width: 45px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></td><td style=\"width: 190px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond\">Svargrond</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty Bay</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope\">Port Hope</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a>. Missions also take you to <a href=\"#/wiki/Outlaw%20Camp\">Outlaw Camp</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'Dendriel</a> and the inner parts of <a href=\"#/wiki/Tiquanda\">Tiquanda</a>.</td><td>Ability to trade with <a href=\"#/wiki/Rashid\">Rashid</a>, achievement <a href=\"#/wiki/Recognised%20Trader\">Recognised Trader</a>.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>","quests":["hot-cuisine-quest"]}